<% content_for :title, "VIP subscription terms" %>
<section class="space-y-5 px-5 py-8 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">
  <%= link_to "← VIP", vip_path %>
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-950">VIP subscription terms</h1>
  <p>VIP provides AI assistance for English conversations. Voice conversations remain free. AI outputs can be inaccurate; pronunciation guides are approximate.</p>
  <p>VIP is a monthly, automatically renewing subscription. The purchase screen shows the price, billing currency, applicable taxes, and renewal terms before you confirm. Payment is charged through the service you choose: Paddle on the web, Apple on iOS, or Google Play on Android.</p>
  <p>Your subscription works on your signed-in say one thing account across supported devices. Use the same account and avoid buying a second subscription on another platform.</p>
  <p>You can cancel renewal through the original payment service. Cancellation normally retains access until the end of the paid period. Refunds and revoked purchases may end access earlier. Refund requests are handled by the original payment service under its terms and applicable consumer rights.</p>
  <p>Deleting your app account does not itself cancel a subscription with a payment service. Cancel your subscription before deleting your account to avoid further charges.</p>
  <p><%= link_to "Contact support", support_path, class: "font-bold text-indigo-600" %> for subscription assistance.</p>
</section>
